  m_Text: "Size: 72 mm\n\nA squid-like creature from the Cambrian era. \n\nAuthor
    note: This 3D model was based on reconstructions from 1980. In the 30 years since
    these drawings, science's view of the fossils have changed. The actual nectocaris
    looked more like a modern squid, making this render a poor representation of what
    this creature actually looked like."
