  m_Color: {r: 0.19607843, g: 0.19607843, b: 0.19607843, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
    m_TypeName: UnityEngine.UI.MaskableGraphic+CullStateChangedEvent, UnityEngine.UI,
      Version=1.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null
  m_FontData:
    m_Font: {fileID: 12800000, guid: 1661911a063af41dd9de29a01f7f9457, type: 3}
    m_FontSize: 14
    m_FontStyle: 0
    m_BestFit: 1
    m_MinSize: 1
    m_MaxSize: 20
    m_Alignment: 1
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'Author Note:


    What suprised me the most while doing research about the Cambrian was a) the diversity
    and complexity of animals, and b) truly how small all the organisms were. The
    largest predator, for example, was the size of a large dog. Most organisms were
    about the size of a house key. Imagining a rich and diverse landscape full of
    tiny swimming alien organisms was a fascinating experience.'
