    m_Alignment: 1
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "Small predatory arthropods swim among large clusters of sponges.\n\nAlthough
    corals had evolved by the time the Cambrian came around, they were rare in number
    compared to the diversity of sponges. Instead of the coral reefs, the Cambrian
    had Sponge reefs. \n"
