    m_Alignment: 1
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "Size: 90 mm\n\nTrilobites were the most dominant organism that lived during
    the Cambrian. There were dozens of species that were uncovered from the Burgess
    shale. \n\nThey are a type of arthropod. They are now extinct."
