    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "\nIn this cave, deep beneath the rocks of what would later form the Canadian
    Rockies of Canada, we see that there was in fact life. \n\nA bizarre little worm
    labeled 'Hallucigenia' walks among the sponges it feeds on. \n\nThe Cambrian evolved
    a variety of bizarre and strange lifeforms, this being only the first of many."
